      "sourceUrl": "https://www.boisemetalworks.com/contact/",
      "quote": "Upload your Idea Here (16M Max)"
    },
    {
      "statement": "The company handles both small jobs and large custom or repeat manufacturing runs, assigning a dedicated point of contact for each project.",
